            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA provides for an update to the prescribing information (PI) to include lesser identified CYP2C9 polymorphisms in Use in Specific Populations (8.6) and Clinical Pharmacology (12.5) sections, and to amend the current vaccine recommendations to prescribers in the Warnings and Precautions (5.1) and Drug Interactions (7.4) sections of the PI.",
